        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about.html">About</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="tool-hero">
  <div class="container tool-hero-inner">
    <div class="tool-badge"><i class="bi bi-cash-stack me-1"></i>EOSB Calculator</div>
    <h1>End of Service Gratuity Calculator</h1>
    <p>Calculate your exact Saudi Arabia EOSB gratuity — based on official Labour Law Article 84.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row g-4 g-lg-5">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <div class="calc-card">
        <h2 style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:.4rem">Calculate Your Gratuity</h2>
        <p style="font-size:.88rem;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Based on official Saudi Labour Law (Article 84)</p>

        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <label class="calc-label" for="eosbSalary">Basic Monthly Salary (SAR)</label>
            <input type="number" class="calc-input" id="eosbSalary" placeholder="e.g. 10000" min="0">
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <label class="calc-label" for="eosbYears">Years of Service</label>
            <input type="number" class="calc-input" id="eosbYears" placeholder="e.g. 5" min="0" step="0.1">
          </div>
          <div class="col-12">
            <label class="calc-label" for="eosbReason">Reason for Leaving</label>
            <select class="calc-select" id="eosbReason">
              <option value="terminated">Terminated by employer</option>
              <option value="resigned">Resigned (2–5 years)</option>
              <option value="resigned5">Resigned (5+ years)</option>
              <option value="resigned2">Resigned (under 2 years — no EOSB)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="col-12">
            <button class="btn-calc" onclick="calcEOSB()"><i class="bi bi-calculator me-2"></i>Calculate Gratuity</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="result-box" id="eosbResult">
          <div class="result-main" id="eosbTotal">SAR 0</div>
          <div class="result-label">Total End of Service Gratuity</div>
          <div id="eosbBreakdown"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-box mt-3">
          <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i>
          <div>EOSB is calculated on <strong>basic salary only</strong> — not allowances, bonuses, or overtime. Calculated per Saudi Labour Law Article 84.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="calc-card mt-4">
        <h2 style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text-primary);margin-bottom:1rem">How EOSB is Calculated</h2>
        <div style="font-size:.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.75">
          <p>Saudi Labour Law calculates end of service gratuity in two tiers:</p>
          <ul style="padding-left:1.25rem">
            <li><strong>First 5 years:</strong> Half month's basic salary per year</li>
            <li><strong>After 5 years:</strong> One full month's basic salary per year</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Example:</strong> SAR 10,000/month × 7 years = (5 × 5,000) + (2 × 10,000) = <strong>SAR 45,000</strong></p>
          <p>If you resign before completing 2 years, you receive no EOSB. If you resign after 2 years but before 5, you receive one-third of the amount. After 5 years, you receive the full calculation regardless of whether you resigned or were terminated.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-4">
      <div class="sidebar-widget">
        <div class="sidebar-widget-title">Other Tools</div>
        <a href="/tools/eosb-calculator.html" class="related-tool">
          <div class="related-tool-icon" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);color:#059669"><i class="bi bi-cash-stack"></i></div>
          <div><span class="related-tool-title">EOSB Calculator</span><span class="related-tool-desc">End of service gratuity</span></div>
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/salary-calculator.html" class="related-tool">
          <div class="related-tool-icon" style="background:rgba(15,98,254,.1);color:var(--primary)"><i class="bi bi-currency-dollar"></i></div>
          <div><span class="related-tool-title">Salary Calculator</span><span class="related-tool-desc">Gulf salary benchmarks</span></div>
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/net-salary-calculator.html" class="related-tool">
          <div class="related-tool-icon" style="background:rgba(139,92,246,.1);color:#7c3aed"><i class="bi bi-wallet2"></i></div>
          <div><span class="related-tool-title">Net Salary Calculator</span><span class="related-tool-desc">Take-home after GOSI</span></div>
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/overtime-calculator.html" class="related-tool">
          <div class="related-tool-icon" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.1);color:#d97706"><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i></div>
          <div><span class="related-tool-title">Overtime Calculator</span><span class="related-tool-desc">Legal overtime pay</span></div>
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/notice-period-calculator.html" class="related-tool">
          <div class="related-tool-icon" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);color:#dc2626"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check"></i></div>
          <div><span class="related-tool-title">Notice Period Calculator</span><span class="related-tool-desc">Last working day</span></div>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="sidebar-widget">
        <div class="sidebar-widget-title">Find a Job</div>
        <p style="font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:1rem">Browse thousands of verified jobs in Saudi Arabia and the Gulf.</p>
        <a href="/" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.75rem;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;border-radius:11px;font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.88rem;text-decoration:none">
          <i class="bi bi-briefcase-fill"></i> Browse Jobs
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="footer-brand mb-2"><span class="brand-name" id="footer-site-name">JobOrbit</span></div>
        <p class="footer-desc">Connecting talent with opportunity across the Gulf region.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <h6 class="footer-heading">Quick Links</h6>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="/">Browse Jobs</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tools/">Career Tools</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact.html">Post a Job</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <h6 class="footer-heading">Legal &amp; Info</h6>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          <li><a href="/about.html">About Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/feedback.html">Contact Us</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy-policy.html">Privacy Policy</a></li>
